WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.130
About AD 30, a small Jewish movement
in Jerusalem follows Jesus as Messiah.

2
00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:11.100
By about 300, there are churches
in almost every city of the empire.

3
00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:14.780
No army, and being Christian
could cost your life.

4
00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:19.120
In Lyons, in 177, a slave woman, Blandina,

5
00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:22.010
is tortured from morning to evening.

6
00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:26.360
So how did a banned faith with
no army grow across an empire,

7
00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:28.470
and did its martyrs help?

8
00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:33.230
In this mission, you'll sort the religious
and political factors behind the spread.

9
00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:38.040
Then you'll meet three martyrs, and
weigh up how much their deaths mattered.

10
00:00:38.090 --> 00:00:42.180
Your mission: explain how a banned
faith spread across an empire,

11
00:00:42.230 --> 00:00:44.120
and weigh up its martyrs' part.
